       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CMF2R7.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RESPONSE-STATE       PIC X VALUE 'S'.
       01  WS-MONTH-WINDOW-CLOSED PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       01  WS-ESCALATION-OPEN      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       1000-MAIN.
           ACCEPT WS-RESPONSE-STATE
           ACCEPT WS-MONTH-WINDOW-CLOSED
           IF WS-RESPONSE-STATE NOT = 'S'
              IF WS-MONTH-WINDOW-CLOSED = 'Y'
                 MOVE 'Y' TO WS-ESCALATION-OPEN
              END-IF
           END-IF
           DISPLAY WS-ESCALATION-OPEN
           STOP RUN.
